Four further System 47 CPCLs recorded OK/PB. Continue available testing, ou=
tstanding I/O and CWA/Punch B close-out across these systems.
System 82 =96 Electrical
Final preparations for digital functional testing planned from Monday 19 Oc=
tober. Confirm satisfactory simulation checks, electrical switching require=
ments, functional test arrangements and Siemens/operator support before com=
mencing.
